k Radnić, Better, Slovenia", "Jussara Rotzsch, Hospital Alemão Oswaldo Cruz, Brazil", "Terje Sagmyr, Helse Vest IKT, Norway (openEHR Editor)", "Andre Smitt-Ingebretsen, Sørlandet sykehus HF, Norway", "Natalia Strauch, Medizinische Hochschule Hannover, Germany", "Norwegian Review Summary, Norwegian Public Hospitals, Norway", "Nyree Taylor, CSIRO, Australia", "John Tore Valand, Helse Vest IKT, Norway (openEHR Editor)", "Ina Wille, Helse-Vest RHF, Norway", "Karsten Øvretveit, Helse Vest IKT, Norway (openEHR Editor)">
